        <h2>1. Project Overview</h2>
        <p>Project Aegis aims to develop an integrated ecosystem of assistive technologies and policy frameworks designed specifically for individuals with diverse disabilities. The goal is not merely to provide tools, but to fundamentally alter the environment in which these individuals live, work, and socialize.</p>
