        <h2>2. Core Research Pillars</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Neurodiversity & Cognitive Support:</strong> Developing AI-driven interfaces that adapt to individual cognitive processing speeds, ensuring that information is presented in the most accessible format possible.</li>
            <li><strong>Physical Mobility & Environmental Design:</strong> Utilizing computer vision to map physical spaces in real-time, identifying barriers and suggesting modifications before they become obstacles.</li>
            <li><strong>Social Inclusion:</strong> Creating platforms that facilitate meaningful social connections, reducing isolation through gamified community building tools.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

